  <!-- EN: Holy Hand grenade -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.label>神圣手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.label>
  <!-- EN: Brother Maynard brought this with him.\n\nBible, Lost Book of Armaments, Capital III, Verse 9-21: And Saint Attiloc raised the hand grenade up on high, saying, "O Lord, bless this Thy hand grenade that, with it, Thou mayest blow Thine enemies to tiny bits in Thy mercy." And the Lord did grin, and the people did feast upon the lambs and sloths and carp and anchovies and orangutans and breakfast cereals and fruit bats and large chu... - -Skips- - And the Lord spake, saying, "First shalt thou take out the Holy Pin. Then, shalt thou count to three. No more. No less. Three shalt be the number thou shalt count, and the number of the counting shall be three. Four shalt thou not count, nor either count thou two, excepting that thou then proceed to three. Five is right out. Once the number three, being the third number, be reached, then, lobbest thou thy Holy Hand Grenade of Antioch towards thy foe, who, being naughty in My sight, shall snuff it." -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.description>梅纳德兄弟带来了这个。

《圣经·失落的兵器之书·第三卷》第9-21节：圣阿提洛克将手榴弹高高举起，说道：“哦，主啊，请祝福这属于祢的手榴弹，好让祢能借此，以祢的仁慈将祢的敌人炸得粉碎。” 主便咧嘴一笑，众人便大快朵颐，享用羔羊、树懒、鲤鱼、凤尾鱼、猩猩、早餐麦片、果蝠以及大鼠…… ——省略—— 主发话道：“首先，你当拔出圣针。然后，你当数到三。不多，也不少。三，便是你当数到的数字，计数的数字也当是三。 不可数到四，也不可数到二——除非你随后继续数到三。五绝对不行。一旦数到三——作为第三个数字——你就将你的安提阿圣手榴弹抛向你的敌人，那人在我眼中是悖逆的，必将命丧黄泉。”</Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.verbs.Verb_PowerBeam.label>神圣手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeArmageddon.verbs.Verb_PowerBeam.label>
