  <!-- EN: Stick grenade -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeStalk.label>棒状手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeStalk.label>
  <!-- EN: Stalk Hand Grenade with a unique design. The grenade mounts a Trinitron charge head within a steel cylinder atop a wooden handle. The mixture inside detonates harder than anything else seen so far, while being incredible easy to handle the same time. This type dominated not 1 but 2 of 3 world wars on planet earth, long before the planetary union was founded and the great confederation happened.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these babies. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeStalk.description>一款设计独特的“茎状手榴弹”。该手榴弹的木质手柄顶端装有一个钢制圆筒，圆筒内安装着一个特里尼特龙（Trinitron）装药头。 其内部的混合物爆炸威力远超迄今为止所见的一切，同时操作起来却异常简单。早在行星联盟成立和伟大联邦诞生之前，这种手榴弹就曾主导了地球上三场世界大战中的两场。

弹带上装满了这些小家伙。</Weapon_GrenadeStalk.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeStalk.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>棒状手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeStalk.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Electrocuter -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeStasis.label>电击器</Weapon_GrenadeStasis.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade with a lightning charged blasting unit that detonates on impact. Unloads in a cloud of electricity. Has only limited holding time.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these babies. -->
