弹带里装的都是这些小家伙。</Weapon_GrenadeStasis.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeStasis.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>电击器</Weapon_GrenadeStasis.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
